1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
They made a living mouse’s skin

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,810
transparent.

3
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:03,840
And watched its organs

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,110
moving underneath.

5
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,060
Without making a single cut.

6
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,500
They’d rubbed a food-dye solution

7
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,700
onto its skin.

8
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,010
You see, water and fat

9
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,730
normally bend light differently,

10
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,090
scattering it and hiding what’s underneath.

11
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:16,070
But the dye changes

12
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,880
how the watery parts bend light,

13
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,630
making them behave

14
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:19,930
more like the fat.

15
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:21,750
Then they washed the dye away…

16
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:22,630
and the skin hid

17
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:24,110
the moving organs again.

